y post is really godawful so that's out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1646,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1646-finch181","user":"finch181","date":". 01-12-2014, 03:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1646-finch181","name":"finch181","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1646_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-12T13:39:42-08:00","id":47583,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>finch181</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/47536-probably-a-bad-place-to-post-game-wanted-ads?p=47566#post47566\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is that where people here go? From what I've heard RPGNet is really terrible and facebook is well... facebook. I should have specified I'm really more into online play so nearby gamers probably won't help.</div> </div> </div> </div>RPGNet is the biggest RPG community on the web, with that many people on a site there will be a wide mix of personalities, obviously. They have strict rules about posting, which some people take issue with, but many thousands of people post there without issue. Specifically I was point to the Forum they have for people to find other gamers.<br /> <br /> The Scion Facebook group is a likely place to find other people interested in Scion...a resource. Not a big deal if you don't like Facebook, just trying to point out some links.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Lovely. Any specifc part of the forum? Play by post is really godawful so that's out. </div> </div> </div>If you won't do Play by Post, what sorts of online play do interest you?<br /> <br /> Your best best may be to post what kind of game you are looking for, with details, in the Game Gatherings forum here and wherever else you think may help.<br /> <br /> -MMM","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Owner/Editor - FlamesRising.com","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/949-matt-m-mcelroy","name":"Matt-M-McElroy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar949_2.jpeg","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-12T13:41:58-08:00","id":47584,"title":"","content":"Usually, if you want to run a game, you'd put up a pitch, talk about houserules, game times, platforms (if you're looking for an online game, which is the default). This is the only part of the Scion forum, so you'd have to start a thread. If you want to play, sometimes making a thread about wanting an ST will net you one, but it's only worked once in my experience. <br /> <br /> Play by Posts are really popular, but in Scion we seem to have an even mix of PbP and Real time, though the amount of games that are started are usually far and few between.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1012-sorcerymon","name":"Sorcerymon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1012_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}